### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
###  AI Catalog  /api/ai/catalog  (skills .md + specs .yaml)
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### Render the system prompt the agent sees (base.md + templates)
GET {{flow_weaver_backend_HostAddress}}/api/ai/catalog/prompt

### List all operations parsed from /Specs/*.yaml
GET {{flow_weaver_backend_HostAddress}}/api/ai/catalog/operations

### Filter: only netbox GETs matching "device"
GET {{flow_weaver_backend_HostAddress}}/api/ai/catalog/operations?api=netbox&method=GET&keyword=device

### Drill into one operation
GET {{flow_weaver_backend_HostAddress}}/api/ai/catalog/operations/dcim_devices_list

### Re-index after editing a spec file on disk
POST {{flow_weaver_backend_HostAddress}}/api/ai/catalog/reload

###
